config BR2_PACKAGE_DEVOURER
	bool "devourer"
	default n
	help
	  Userspace Realtek USB Wi-Fi driver (Jaguar3 RTL8812EU/8822EU on
	  this board). Source-only: nothing is installed on target. mabur's
	  CMake pulls it in with add_subdirectory() and links it statically
	  into maburd, so this package exists purely to place the tree where
	  mabur.mk can point -DDEVOURER_DIR at it.

	  https://github.com/gilankpam/devourer
